:: A3 Brothers Talk 1 [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "You follow Sabelle and Aishui into the workshop. You were expecting the sound of sawing, drilling, soldering, sparks flying, yet your footsteps echo in a void. The only other thing you can hear is the sound of an argument from the end of the hall.">>
<<stage "As you approach the din, Sabelle turns to you.">>
<<say "Sabelle" "So, we do have a bit of a... Technical hitch." "wincing">>
<<stage "You round the final workbench and stop in your tracks. Standing before you are two physically identical, lanky old mechanics, dressed up in messy overalls.">> 
<<stage "You say two, but there may as well be one. Something, or someone has bound these two poor souls together side-by-side with some contraption made of coral and strong, binding seaweed. The two identical men form one kind of being, one on the left, one on the right. Right now, they are doubled-up, face-to-face, bickering and arguing.">>
<<stage "Sabelle smiles coyly at you. Oh yeah, they are definitely responsible for this.">>
<<say "Aishui" "This is Willun and Abol.  Atlantis' finest mechanics!" "genially">>
<<say "Sabelle" "And crankiest twin brothers!" "whispered">>
<<stage "The two identical, bickering old men haven't even registered your presence. You clear your throat.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Pleased to meet you, gentlemen." "A3 Brothers Talk 1b" >>
<</choices>>

:: A3 Brothers Talk 1b [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The brothers keep on arguing. You raise your voice.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "So... Which one of you is Willun?" "A3 Brothers Talk 2a" >>
<<reply "So... Which one of you is Abol?" "A3 Brothers Talk 2b" >>
<</choices>>

:: A3 Brothers Talk 2a [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The brothers stop and turn to you.">>
<<say "Left Brother" "I am!" "indignant">>
<<say "Right Brother" "I am!" "indignant">>
<<stage "They jab an identical accusatory finger at one another.">>
<<say "Left Brother" "No you're not!" "furious">>
<<say "Right Brother" "No you're not" "furious">>
<<stage "Yeah... this is going to be trouble. The brothers get back to arguing.">>
<<say "Sabelle" "Me and Aishui, we just wanted them to learn to get along, you know?" "whispered">>
<<say "Aishui" "I asked Sabelle to design something that could keep them as close as possible. So they could put their differences aside." "hushed">>
<<say "Sabelle" "I guess they put too many differences aside, because after a few days they forgot which Brother they are!" "sniggering">>
<<say "Aishui" "Now they're in a bigger argument than before! And they won't help us fix anything until we can solve it!" "hushed">>
<<say "Sabelle" "If you can find some way to tell which one is which, we can get them to fix the Manta Ray Ornithopter. All we really know about them is that Willun was the hands-on brother, and Abol was the brains..." "whispered">>
<<stage "You look closely at the pair. They really are identical. This isn't going to be easy, but here goes nothing. You raise your voice again.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Willun, you must be strong after all that... fixing." "A3 Brothers Talk 3a" >>
<<reply "Abol... maybe I could pick your brains sometime, I hear you're a smart one." "A3 Brothers Talk 3b" >>
<</choices>>

