:: A3 Brothers Talk 3a [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The brothers turn to you once more.">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Why, thank you!" "flattered">>
<<say "Right Brother" "Why, thank you" "flattered">>
<<say "Left Brother" "HEY!" "angered">>
<<say "Right Brother" "HEY!" "angered">>
<<say "Left Brother" "He was talking to ME, you fishwit!" "abrasive">>
<<say "Right Brother" "No, he was talking to ME, you mollusc brain! "abusive"">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Willun, I swear..." "threatening">>
<<say "Right Brother" "I ain't Willun! YOU'RE Willun!" "defensive">>
<<say "Left Brother" "The heck I am! I'm most certainly Abol!" "indignant">>
<<say "Right Brother" "I'M ABOL!" "furious">>
<<stage "You turn to Sabelle and Aishui. They both shrug in unison.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "This is really like one of those riddles, where the one gatekeeper is a liar and the other always tells the truth." "A3 Brothers Talk 4a" -10>>
<<reply "This is above my pay grade. I'm going to just let you guys hash it out for the time being." "A3 Brothers Talk 4b" 10>>
<</choices>>

