:: A3 Brothers Talk 4a [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<say "Left Brother" "No it isn't!" "scornful">>
<<say "Right Brother" "No it isn't!" "scornful">>
<<stage "They shake their heads in unison.">>
<<say "Left Brother" "It's nothing like that riddle!" "indignant">>
<<say "Right Brother" "Have you ever even solved one of those riddles?" "mocking">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Can't have, otheriwise they wouldn't be making such foolish comparisons!" "abrasive">>
<<say "Right Brother" "I used to solve those riddles all the time!" "boastful">>
<<say "Left Brother" "No you didn't! That was me!" "furious">>
<<stage "With wounded pride, you step back towards Aishui and Sabelle.">>
<<say "Sabelle" "Well, at least they weren't arguing with each other for a minute!" "smirking">>
<<say "Aishui" "That's a good thing, right?" "cheerful">>
<<stage "Getting through to the Brothers feels like a hopeless task. You need to find some kind of evidence to prove which one is which.">>
