:: A3 Brothers Talk 4b [dialogue act3 char-Willun] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The brothers stop arguing and smile at you, sweetly.">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Now isn't that polite!" "gently">>
<<say "Right Brother" "Such good manners." "approving">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Someone who understands when to give folk a little space." "proud">>
<<say "Right Brother" "That's that emotional intelligence, I've been talking about!" "excited">>
<<say "Left Brother" "Pains me to say it, but you've always been good with that." "warmly">>
<<say "Right Brother" "Me! YOU were always good with that!" "abrupt">>
<<say "Left Brother" "ME!? My emotional intelligence stinks!" "forceful">>
<<say "Right Brother" "Not as much as mine, Willun!" "determined">>
<<say "Left Brother" "ABOL!" "furious">>
<<stage "You let out a sigh that reverberates around your helmet. You step back towards Aishui and Sabelle.">>
<<say "Sabelle" "Well, at least they were agreeing with each other for a minute!" "wincing">>
<<say "Aishui" "We're on the right path! Maybe?" "cheerful">>
<<stage "Getting through to the Brothers feels like a hopeless task. You need to find some kind of evidence to prove which one is which.">>
